doctype html
html(lang="en")
  head
    meta(charset="utf-8")
    meta(
      name="viewport",
      content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1, viewport-fit=cover"
    )
    meta(name="description", content=site.description)
    meta(name="author", content="Pierre Estrabaud")
    meta(name="theme-color", content="#0f1624")

    title= site.title

    link(rel="canonical", href=site.url)
    link(rel="icon", type="image/x-icon", href="assets/img/favicon.ico")

    // Open Graph / social previews
    meta(property="og:type", content="website")
    meta(property="og:url", content=site.url)
    meta(property="og:title", content=site.title)
    meta(property="og:description", content=site.description)
    meta(property="og:image", content=site.image)
    meta(property="og:image:width", content="1200")
    meta(property="og:image:height", content="630")
    meta(name="twitter:card", content="summary_large_image")

    // Fonts (self-hosted, see src/scss/_fonts.scss): preload the ones used above the fold
    each font in fonts
      link(
        rel="preload",
        href=`assets/fonts/${font}.woff2`,
        as="font",
        type="font/woff2",
        crossorigin
      )

    // Apply the saved theme before the first paint (see the theme toggle in main.js)
    script.
      try {
        var t = localStorage.getItem("theme");
        if (t) document.documentElement.dataset.theme = t;
      } catch (e) {}
    link(href=asset("css/styles.css"), rel="stylesheet")
    script(type="module", src=asset("js/main.js"))

    // Icons: Font Awesome Free (https://fontawesome.com/license/free), inlined as SVG at build time

  body
    nav#nav.nav(aria-label="Main")
      .container.nav-inner
        a.brand(href="#top")
          img(src="assets/img/avatar.webp", alt="", width="30", height="30")
          | Pierre Estrabaud
        .nav-right
          ul#nav-links.nav-links
            each item in nav
              li
                a(href=`#${item.id}`)= item.label
          button#theme-button.nav-button(
            type="button",
            aria-label="Switch to dark theme"
          )
            span.theme-icon-dark
              +icon("solid/moon")
            span.theme-icon-light
              +icon("solid/sun")
          button#menu-button.nav-button.menu-button(
            type="button",
            aria-expanded="false",
            aria-controls="nav-links",
            aria-label="Menu"
          )
            +icon("solid/bars")

    header#top.hero
      canvas(aria-hidden="true")
      .container
        .hero-content
          span.eyebrow TECH LEAD · AUDITAGENT
          h1
            | Pierre
            br
            | Estrabaud
          p.tagline Software engineer. AI, security and blockchain.
          p.intro
            | I lead engineering on #[a(href="https://auditagent.nethermind.io/") AuditAgent], Nethermind's AI
            | security scanner for smart contracts, after several years building dApps and writing Solidity smart
            | contracts. I also write about web3 security and CTF challenges on my
            | #[a(href="https://blog.pedrojok.com") blog], and about using AI well in the
            | #[a(href="https://ai-playbook.pedrojok.com/") AI Playbook].
          .hero-actions
            +contact
        .hero-art
          .hud(aria-hidden="true")
            span
              span.hud-dot
              | SCANNING
            span 180 NODES
            span
              | FINDINGS #[b(data-hud="found") 0]
      a.scroll-cue(href="#experience") SCROLL ↓

    main
      section#experience.section(aria-labelledby="experience-title")
        .container
          .section-head
            span.kicker Experience · 2007 → now
            h2#experience-title Experience
          .timeline
            article.job
              .when Apr 2024 → now
              div
                h3 Nethermind
                p.org
                  | Remote · #[a(href="https://www.nethermind.io/") nethermind.io]
                .roles
                  .role.is-current
                    h4 Tech Lead, AuditAgent
                    .when Nov 2024 → now
                    ul
                      li
                        | Lead a team of 4 engineers building
                        | #[a(href="https://auditagent.nethermind.io/") AuditAgent], an AI security scanner for
                        | Solidity, Cairo and Rust smart contracts.
                      li Run the AI security scanner on Kubernetes, with KEDA autoscaling.
                      li.stats
                        span.stat 6M+ lines of code scanned
                        span.stat 44K+ vulnerabilities found
                  .role
                    h4 AI Security Engineer, AuditAgent
                    .when Aug 2024 → Nov 2024
                    ul
                      li
                        | Joined the AuditAgent team after my internship to build an AI-powered security solution
                        | that identifies vulnerabilities in smart contracts.
                  .role
                    h4 Smart Contracts Auditor (Intern), Audit Team
                    .when Apr 2024 → Jul 2024
                    ul
                      li Audited Solidity (EVM) and Cairo codebases to identify and mitigate security vulnerabilities.
                      li
                        | Reviewed and analyzed audit findings to ensure the reliability and safety of blockchain
                        | applications.

            article.job
              .when Jan 2022 → Nov 2023
              div
                h3 Lead Blockchain Developer
                p.org
                  | Meed (formerly SuperUltra) · Remote ·
                  | #[a(href="https://www.meedloyalty.com/") meedloyalty.com]
                ul
                  li
                    | Engineered and developed 5 blockchain-based solutions (DApps), from smart contracts to
                    | back-end and front-end integration across 4 EVM networks, including Ethereum, Polygon, BSC,
                    | and Cronos.
                  li
                    | Collaborated remotely with a team of 5-10 people in a dynamic startup environment, leveraging
                    | agile methodologies.
                  li
                    | Provided strategic guidance to clients on the development of Web3 products and games,
                    | ensuring solid blockchain integration for improved functionality and user engagement.

            article.job
              .when Oct 2017 → Jul 2022
              div
                h3 Cryptocurrency Miner
                p.org Self-employed · Thailand
                p.desc
                  | Ran a mining farm of ASIC miners (3 algorithms) and a self-built 6-GPU rig, tuned for efficiency
                  | through BIOS flashing, overclocking and undervolting.

            article.job
              .when Jul 2020 → Dec 2021
              div
                h3 Blockchain Developer
                p.org Freelance
                ul
                  li
                    | Developed and deployed smart contracts for multiple DApps, with a focus on enhancing user
                    | experience by creating intuitive front-ends.
                  li
                    | Committed to continuous learning by staying updated on the latest developments in the Ethereum
                    | ecosystem, Solidity best practices, and Web3 technologies.

            article.job
              .when Aug 2017 → Jun 2021
              div
                h3 Translator, Crypto and IT (English to French)
                p.org
                  | Freelance · Clients: #[a(href="https://phemex.com") Phemex],
                  | #[a(href="https://paybis.com/") Paybis], Microsoft Azure
                p.desc Translated 30+ technical white papers during the 2017/2018 ICO boom.

            article.job
              .when 2007 → 2012
              div
                h3 Earlier
                p.desc
                  | Owner and manager of an internet cafe in Bangkok (2011 - 2012), and IT help desk for the 1,500+
                  | Système U supermarkets in Montpellier (2007 - 2008).

      section#skills.section(aria-labelledby="skills-title")
        .container
          .section-head
            span.kicker Skills · #{ skills.length - 1 } areas
            h2#skills-title Skills
          .skills
            each group in skills
              .skill-group
                h3= group.title
                ul.chips
                  each item in group.items
                    li= item

      section#projects.section(aria-labelledby="projects-title")
        .container
          .section-head
            span.kicker Portfolio & open source · #{ projects.length } projects
            h2#projects-title Projects
          .projects
            each p in projects
              +project(p)

      section#awards.section(aria-labelledby="awards-title")
        .container.two-col
          div
            .section-head
              span.kicker Awards & certifications
              h2#awards-title Awards
            ul.findings
              li.finding
                span.place 1#[sup st]
                strong
                  a(
                    href="https://blog.chain.link/block-magic-winners/#gaming_&_consumer_apps_($15_000)"
                  ) Chainlink Block Magic Hackathon
                span.meta May 2024
              li.finding
                span.place 2#[sup nd]
                strong
                  a(href="https://moralis.io/cronos-hackathon/") Moralis x Cronos Hackathon
                span.meta September 2022
            p.sub-head Certifications
            ul.plain-list
              li
                span
                  | Ethereum Dapp Programming · #[a(href="https://academy.moralis.io/") Moralis Academy]
                span.year 2021
              li
                span Ethereum Smart-Contract Security · Ivan on Tech Blockchain Academy
                span.year 2021
          div
            .section-head
              span.kicker Education
              h2 Education
            .education
              div
                h3 Moralis Academy
                p
                  | Blockchain, DeFi and Smart-Contract Programming ·
                  | #[span.mono Sep 2020 → Oct 2021]
              div
                h3 Paul Valery University
                p
                  | Bachelor of Arts in Economics · #[span.mono Sep 2004 → Jun 2007]

      section#interests.section.prose(aria-labelledby="interests-title")
        .container
          .section-head
            span.kicker Off the keyboard
            h2#interests-title Interests
          p
            | Apart from work, I have been traveling a lot around the world, from
            | playing poker in Vegas, diving in Thailand, skydiving in New Zealand, climbing over 6,000 m in Ladakh
            | in Northern India, and going over the polar circle in Norway. I eventually settled in Thailand's
            | countryside, where I enjoy a quiet life with my wife and kids.
          p
            | Here is my website relating most of my adventures:
            | #[a(href="https://www.voyageboost.com") voyageboost.com]

    footer#contact.footer
      .container
        span.kicker Contact
        h2 Let's talk.
        .footer-actions
          +contact
        p.footer-fine © 2026 Pierre Estrabaud
